    "resolution": "Wrong as worded, and the contrast differs. +2.75pp is below both gate point estimates (+3.45pp, +5.20pp). The gates compared the bundle (knobs + prior) with the plain control (neither), and the gate write-up says it had no knobs-only or prior-only arm. D-P here is the prior alone on top of the knobs, at 4000/16000. So the gates give no direct reference for D-P. Nothing numeric changes; final.txt drops the claim."
   },
   {
