    "resolution": "Resolved by outside evidence: the ship identity record (docs/experiments/2026-10-25-ic-bundle-ship-identity.md \u00a712) shows that on this same PGO .so (823fa393...) Ironclad full runs replay seed-for-seed (51 of 51 identity checks, 0 differences, including a PRIOR_NET=off arm that reproduces its prior-off reference). That was at 1000/4000 on seeds 96,509,000-043, not at 4000/16000. Given that, a no-op off switch would have made P replay D on all 400 seeds."
   }
